[ti:Hard Times Come Again No More]
[ar:Stephen Foster]
[00:00.00]Let us pause in life's pleasures and count its many tears
[00:25.80]While we all sup sorrow with the poor
[00:57.92]There's a song that will linger forever in our ears
[01:02.92]Oh hard times come again no more
[01:08.90]Tis the song, the sigh of the weary
[01:13.90]Hard times, hard times, come again no more
[01:18.90]Many days you have lingered around my cabin door
[01:24.40]Oh hard times come again no more
